  "details": "For each event defined in the udon program, I would like an \"Invoke\" button while in play mode to manually fire that event and test it out.\nIf you haven't seen EasyEventEditor, that adds an Invoke button this for UI controls to allow testing them.\nCurrently, there's no good interface for testing stuff. There's OnMouseDown but that seems hard to work with. OnEnable can cause weird race conditions depending on which order child objects are enabled, so I'd rather not use that.",
